  {
   "id": 2,
   "kind": "page",
   "heading": "一　充电要多少功",
   "narration": "一，先算充电要多少功。设电容为 C，某时刻极板带电 q、电压 u 等于 q 除以 C。再搬一小块电荷 dq 过去，要克服电压做功，dW 等于 u dq。从零充到 Q，把 dW 积起来：W 等于 q 除以 C 从零积到 Q，得 Q 平方除以二 C。这个功全部储存在电容器里，成为电场能。所以电容器的储能，就是充电过程中外力做的功。",
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 0,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 137,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 90,
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "一　充电要多少功",
        "size": 48,
        "color": "#C00000",
        "b": true
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 1,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 244,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 52,
     "align": "center",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "某时刻带电 $q$、电压 $u=q/C$；再搬 $\\mathrm dq$ 过去：",
        "size": 31,
        "color": "#111111",
        "b": false
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 2,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 320,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 130,
     "tex": "\\mathrm dW=u\\,\\mathrm dq=\\dfrac{q}{C}\\mathrm dq",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#111111",
     "align": "center"
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 3,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 470,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 140,
     "tex": "W=\\int_0^Q\\dfrac{q}{C}\\mathrm dq=\\dfrac{Q^{2}}{2C}",
     "size": 36,
     "color": "#C00000",
     "align": "center"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 4,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 630,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 52,
     "align": "center",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "这个功全部储存在电容器里 ⇒ 电场能．",
        "size": 31,
        "color": "#111111",
        "b": false
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 5,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 712,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 50,
     "align": "center",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "所以电容器储能 = 充电过程中外力做的功．",
        "size": 31,
        "color": "#666",
        "b": false
       }
      ]
     ]
    }
